# Ignore rules for `docker build -f api/Dockerfile .` from the repository root.
# BuildKit prefers <dockerfile>.dockerignore over the context's .dockerignore,
# which is what makes this build possible: the root .dockerignore excludes `api`.
#
# Everything the api image does not need is excluded here, so widening the build
# context does not widen what gets sent to the daemon.
.git
.gitignore
.env
.env.*
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/test-results
*.log
*.md
logs
docs
tests
explorer-ui
preis-ui
src
scripts
ops
api/tests
clickhouse/docs
clickhouse/Dockerfile
typegen.json
vitest.config.ts
